            "review_title": "Review at Mr Ho Bistro Restaurant",
            "review_text": "molly0411\nBallarat, Australia54 contributions\n0\nLittle oasis next to Ben Thanh Market\nAug 2017 • Family\nWe discovered this lovely little bistro during our last day of power shopping in Ho Chi Minh, and were so impressed we came back for dinner the same night. \nThe staff were very welcoming, helpful, friendly and easy to communicate with. They made some fabulous recommendations and we were not disappointed with any of the meals. \nThe food is very fresh, delicious and well presented. It is very reasonably priced and serving sizes are perfect!\nThe cocktails were very cheap and as good as any you would be served in a flashy bar in Australia. \nThe Vietnamese music playing in the bistro was also very calming and appropriate for the venue and the toilets were super clean! \nNext time we are in HCM we will be back and highly recommend it to other weary power shoppers.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 5, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
