            "review_text": "PTC\nAustralia32 contributions\n0\nTwo thumbs up from the kids!\nMar 2017 • Family\nStumbled upon this restaurant while exploring around our hotel. Great food and great staff. We had the spring rolls, rice paper rolls, beef noodle soup and diced wagyu beef. The food was fresh and cooked to perfection. The kids loved the spring rolls and were entertained by the great wait staff while we had a few cheeky beers while watching the hustle and bustle along le loi street. We will definitely come back when we return to Ho Chi Minh.\nRead more\nWritten April 8, 2017",
